Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:01.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Para conseguir lo que quieres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tienes que ser la persona
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:02.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que ya lo tiene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:03.79,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Quieres vivir de tu proyecto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.79,0:00:04.69,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te sientas y dices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:05.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿cómo me voy a sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:06.99,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}bien si tengo 100€
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:07.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en la cuenta y estoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.26,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}estresado todo el puto día?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:09.68,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y ahí se queda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:10.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la mayoría de gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:11.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}chocando con lo que ve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en su realidad hoy mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:13.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pero tu vida no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:14.44,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}se crea fuera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu vida se crea dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en lo que tú crees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:16.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que mereces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:17.35,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y en lo que crees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que eres capaz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pregúntate realmente cómo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:20.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}serías y cómo te comportarías
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:21.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}si ya vivieras
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:22.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de tu sueño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.31,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Estarías mucho más tranquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:24.23,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te comportarías de otra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:24.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}manera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.83,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}hablarías de otra manera muy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:26.47,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}distinta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:27.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}otra pose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}un gasto de golpe no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:29.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te tocaría los cojones tanto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Pensarías en el siguiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}proyecto o tendrías un entorno
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.61,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que realmente te apoye?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:34.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y todo eso lo puedes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}hacer hoy mismo gratis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:36.94,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con todo lo que piensas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:37.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sobre ti
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}todo lo que sientes sobre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:39.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}ti lo que mereces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:40.07,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que piensas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:40.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:41.36,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y empezarás a ver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:42.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}oportunidades que siempre han
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:43.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}estado ahí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.05,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero nunca las veías
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:45.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}porque solo estabas centrado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:46.34,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en lo que no tenías
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y en lo que te faltaba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:47.62,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que empieza hoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:48.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empieza a actuar como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:49.82,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo haría esa mejor versión
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:50.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de ti
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}aunque sea pequeña
